OL,3,GNEWSAForce launches chatbot for
OL,4,Anon-emergency calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA North West police force has launched
OL,7,Fa new "AI-powered virtual police
OL,8,Fassistant" on its website in a bid to
OL,9,Fcut down on non-emergency calls.
OL,11,FMerseyside Police has introduced Bobbi,
OL,12,Fa chatbot the force said is to be used
OL,13,Fby the public for non-emergency
OL,14,Fpolice-related queries.
OL,16,FThe virtual assistant can give guidance
OL,17,Fand connect users to the right
OL,18,Fservices, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
