OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAForce launches chatbot for
OL,4,Anon-emergency calls
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are the first force in the North
OL,7,FWest to roll this out," Supt Tony
OL,8,FFairhurst told BBC Radio Merseyside.
OL,9,F"20% of the calls we get to Merseyside
OL,10,FPolice don't need to be dealt with by a
OL,11,Fpolicing operator. AI Bobbi will deal
OL,12,Fwith non-urgent matters - and therefore
OL,13,Ffree up the time for officers."
